HP3000 and Compaq Novell 3.12 platforms.  We are in the midst of
bringing 4 new systems on line based on DEC Unix.  Two systems are
clustered 1000A's and two systems are 2100A's with HSZ40 shared RAID
disks.    Boths sets of systems are configured with both DAT and DLT
tape drives.  We acquired the systems with licenses for NAS200.

All systems will be running production software.  The 1000A's will be
supporting software written in "C" without access to the source code. 
