> [ Details omitted ]

Albert De Knuydt replied:

> We have very similar experiences.  We use a Cisco switch with 5 Alpha's, a
> Sun, a couple of HP's and an Ethernet Switch in one ELAN.  And we have
> frequent (once every couple of days) crashes ever since, especially when
> 'something' occured with the HP's.  We installed the latest firmware, loads
> of patches (both on DEC and HP), but nothing really helps.  We have
> frequent (sometimes several a minute !) messages like this:

> 	ATM LANE - Connection Released, cause = 31

