   registered, and the limited licence has precedence over the unlimited one
   (clever, no?). Thus the base licence had to be deleted this way:
   
# lmf list full for osf-usr
   
       --> two entries, one being called UNIX-SERVER-IMPLICIT-USER
       
# lmf delete osf-usr DEC UNIX-SERVER-IMPLICIT-USER
# lmf reset
# lmf list
       --> only one entry, that from the CD
       
       
