does, and sometimes does not, "automatically" create quotas with
the newly created accounts.   I leave the GUI running most of
the day in order to create new accounts AND modify existing accounts
intermittently as the need arises.  I'm guessing that what may
be happening is that somehow dxaccounts "remembers" someone's quotas
